{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10104140","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10104140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1010414001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요. 많이 지쳐보이는데 도와드릴까요?","source_cn":"你们好，看你们很累的样子，需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9381FD7937B9568E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010414002:1":{"text":"누구시죠? 이곳은 위험합니다. 용무가 없으면 당장 이곳을 떠나세요.","source_cn":"你是谁啊？这附近不安全不知道吗？没事就快点滚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8D59E5CD105C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010414003:1":{"text":"나는 미스릴 상회의 로완. 장원주의 <style=\"highlight\">황금 연회</style>에 초대 받아 왔어. 여기 초대장.","source_cn":"我是秘银商会的罗万，庄园的主人邀请我参加<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x268A474B7C61322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010414004:1":{"text":"손님으로 온 꼬마든, 소란을 피우러 온 꼬마든, 여기서 어슬렁거리지 말고 가거라.","source_cn":"不管你是客人的小孩还是来捣乱的小孩，都别在这附近晃悠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9ECACF6BCD415F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010414005:1":{"text":"우린 바빠서 너 같은 꼬맹이를 상대할 시간 없다고.","source_cn":"我们现在忙得很，没空逗小孩玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0311FB9424AC39AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010414006:1":{"text":"...이게 손님을 대하는 태도야? 너희 고용주에게 전해주도록 하지.","source_cn":"……这就是你们对待客人的态度？我要转达给你们的主人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAE8F0A354E10F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010414007:1":{"text":"말을 전할거면 가서 월급이나 제대로 달라고 전해. \n이 근처의 고블린은 아무리 쫓아내도 끝이 없으니, 원. 이게 사람이 할 일이냐고.","source_cn":"我求你赶紧去，让老爷提前给我们结工资。\\n这附近的咕布...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7DDECAC5A0960E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010414008:1":{"text":"당, 당신들!","source_cn":"你们、你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074CC7A4A4BF1072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010414009:0":{"text":"어서 가, 꼬마 도련님. 이곳은 지나갈 수 없으니 딴 데 가서 놀아라.","source_cn":"走吧，小少爷，此路不通，你换个地方玩泥巴吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05EFD7A3F016DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:疲惫的佣兵":{"text":"피곤한 용병","source":"疲惫的佣兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:焦躁的佣兵":{"text":"조급한 용병","source":"焦躁的佣兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"s